omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MxAjlHOYzUwQ7kNvwFh89TA&_nc_oc=AdolJFeeMZh8pZLbgH__AyiC_qio5_s57H5eXi_iivuGbX0YcYsvZrcBsSnvf7h0rcg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC01gsOCySiBmfxeOYjeW5ITpopRaXlp2XkXCEWxA0oIw&oe=6A53B134"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9wE_kv3pjw8Q7kNvwFEwxE1&_nc_oc=AdoYFMjMt6uZQv2Gef0GZKFc_jVaXn5AZ8kWCKkOfjVWLAu_x2-BLrwplaTb3HltS8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBrVoYj95v8MskwxxwnvECHCooNWpfq0glUHgu1VI7OWA&oe=6A537A56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3DXvdQUOFc8Q7kNvwELIx2u&_nc_oc=Adqb_Kyj2zqI-iXDiSVb6hypOT5W2H_dMdC-e_briy7L8e6zUqjA1rmBKb5byp_cmxw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAH2BbQ3JXPmMgFJwCIkHLQoMhDKTRNaFMBXQXUsnylMw&oe=6A538F77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://